; Satan has been turned into smoke
;
; 0, or $FF once #R$BB57 has seen the chalice taken (#R$8521) and has replaced Satan by the smoke object: it then
; switches the music to track 7 (#R$8551), runs the script #R$82D4 to erase the twelve crosses and clears #R$8542.
; Other entity routines (for instance #R$B6E6) test it and remove themselves while it is set, so that Satan's fire
; disappears.
@label=SatanSmoked
g$8522 DEFB $00
